{"type":"example","type_name":"Example","number":"","title":"Running the claim on a case split","title_html":"Running the claim on a case split","html":"<p>Here is a derivation of <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"p \\vee q \\vdash q\n\\vee p\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45D TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2228\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c22A2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2228\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45D TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>⊢</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi>p</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>. List the context of each line, and check <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_k \\models \\varphi_k\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msub><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c393\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D458 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c22A8\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msub space=\"4\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D711 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: -0.15em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D458 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msub></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>⊨</mo><msub><mi>φ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> for each <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"k\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D458 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>, naming the case of the proof that\nhandles it.</p>","file":"ch04-semantics-soundness-completeness/07-soundness.html"}